<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16910" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσχημ-οσύνη</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>want of form,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. καὶ ἀμορφία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					190b15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				188b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				129.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ungracefulness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				196a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				401a
			</span></i>; <i>awkwardness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				174c
			</span></i>; <i>disfigurement,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ προσώπου,</span> in playing on the
			flute, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1341b5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φέρει</span> brings <i>discredit,
				disgrace,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1126b33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in moral
			sense, <i>indecorum, obscene</i> or <i>disgraceful conduct,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ep.Rom.
				1.27
			</span></i>: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.78
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				61.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> euphem.for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰδοῖον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				18.7
			</span></i>,al.; for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόπατος,</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>De.</u>
				23.13(14)
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
